      <Comment source="xue, PMN, nilo-poyanco">The numbering system used in the naming of 3-dehydroquinate is that of the recommendations on cyclitols, sections I-8 and I-9. The use of the term &apos;5-dehydroquinate&apos; for this compound is based on an earlier system of numbering.</Comment>
